WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.190
Hey, hey.

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.430
Have you heard the rumors?

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.470
Sure have!

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:50.070
About the dream thief, right?

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.470
I heard about that, too!

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:52.470
Me, too!

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.340
Like how it steals the dreams of children?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.350
Yep, yep.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:01.100
The kids lose consciousness after it happens.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.270
And they're still in a daze when they come to.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.430
The dream thief...

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.230
Sca-ry!

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:14.890
I, Yamabuki Saya, do not fear such trifling things.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:16.370
And that's how the great Saya does it!

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:20.460
My father bought me this special habanero spray!

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:23.480
With this in hand, it doesn't matter what manner of scum may appear.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.490
Just spray!

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.720
Like, gross!

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.890
And that's how the great Saya does it!

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:32.930
Well, are you sure about that?

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.810
And what business might you have here?

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:36.810
Please ignore me.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:39.810
I'm merely a Hinamori fan passing through.

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.050
But the way I see it,

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.340
the villain attacking the children must be...

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:46.540
An alien!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.120
An alien?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.690
Wh-What's going on?

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.160
Habanero won't have any effect on aliens.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:01.160
Only one person can oppose them.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.380
Hey.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.720
The legendary grade-schooler.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.600
Humanity's greatest heroine.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.210
Our one and only Hinamori Amu-senpai!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.860
You're in my way.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:16.930
Are you saying my habanero spray is inferior to Hinamori-san?!

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.140
Save me, Hinamori-senpai!

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:23.100
Some strange rumors have been flying around lately.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:24.860
A dream thief, huh?

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.040
It couldn't be...

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:26.830
What?

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:27.850
What do you mean?

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.390
Isn't this Nikaidou's doing?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.400
You guys feel the same way, right?

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:36.050
You mean, even though he left our school,

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:38.810
he's still putting X's on people's eggs?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.740
Perhaps.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.100
In any case, we need to be careful.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:44.540
Extra careful.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.220
Right.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.030
Yeah.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.040
Nikaidou.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.130
Where are you right now?

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:56.680
This should be enough X eggs.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:59.560
The Embryo will soon be completed.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:05.030
Once I prepare a special egg for the Character Transformation, I'm sure...

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:10.600
Guardian Characters Kidnapped!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:10.600
Episode 21

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:13.100
Sorry about this, Amu-chan.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:16.630
We didn't mean to make you watch the house on a Sunday.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.060
It's fine.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:22.600
Your grandmother suddenly told us that she'd sent crabs through refrigerated delivery.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:26.130
They should arrive around noon, so make sure you receive the package for us.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:26.990
Okay.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:30.220
Anyway, you should get going or you'll be late for the party.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:31.560
You're right.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.970
Ami-chan, we're off!

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.850
North wind whoosh!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.870
North wind whoosh!

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.310
Little fairy of the north wind spotted!

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.690
Photogenic time!

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.620
You're awesome, little fairy!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.010
Little fairy, please make the wind blow!

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.440
Whoosh!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.440
So strong!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.310
What a strong wind, little fairy!

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:58.140
Lovely!

00:04:58.140 --> 00:04:58.600
Come, come.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.100
Amu-chan, come get in the picture!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.700
You're gonna be late.

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:03.850
Hinamori

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:03.850
Tsumugu Midori

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:03.850
Amu Ami

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:03.850
See you later!

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.020
Bye-bye!

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:09.410
Have a save trip.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.790
Finally, some peace and quiet.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.390
Okay.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.280
What to do?

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.060
Amu-chan,

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.560
are you sure about this?

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:21.390
What do you mean?

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:26.780
Weren't you looking forward to going to the clothing sale today?

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:27.890
It couldn't be helped.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:31.430
Ami practiced really hard.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.470
I'd feel bad if Mom couldn't go to the party.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.590
Mommy, look!

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:34.470
Whoosh!

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:36.960
Besides, I can go shopping whenever I want.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.730
You're such a good girl, Amu-chan!

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:42.150
Yeah, way to be the big sister!

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.240
Pretty much.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:44.900
I'm so touched.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.300
I'm so impressed.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.190
Especially since the sale ends today.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:50.430
It does?

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.700
That reminds me...

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.520
They mentioned that the first hundred people would get an original pouch as a gift.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.580
They did?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.090
And you get double the points when you buy stuff!

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.190
And you can double your chance at winning with a scratch card!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:05.320
And yet, you sacrificed shopping all for Ami-chan.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.270
How mature.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:08.620
Huh?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.750
Amu-chan.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.580
Are you alive?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:15.480
I'm just fine.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.090
I'm totally okay.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:19.910
O-Oh no!

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.570
Amu-chan's soul!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.350
Su, it went over there!

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.430
Sale...

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.430
The crabs moved.

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:34.390
Really?

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:37.990
Amu-chan.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.640
Don't be so disappointed.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.830
Have some hot chocolate and cheer up.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.440
Whoa, it looks yummy!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.270
Smells good!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:50.770
I made enough for everyone.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:51.840
Really? Really?

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.090
That's our Su!

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:56.270
Please, it's not a big deal.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:59.810
Whoa, these cups are from Ami-chan's dollhouse!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.640
Correct!

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.440
Yep, nice size!

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:05.120
Oh, jeez.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.310
Hold on a sec.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.330
I'll go grab a tissue.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:10.690
Now I've done it.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:12.830
Haste makes waste.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:14.850
That's right...

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:19.870
I used to really hate watching the house.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.490
When I was little, I'd be scared ghosts might pop out at me.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:31.310
Even when I got older, I got bored being all by myself.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.980
But now...

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.250
What is it?

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.290
N-Nothing!

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:46.560
Amu-chan was probably thinking about how much fun it is to watch the house with us!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.970
As if!

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:52.810
In fact, I'm all sad because I never get any quiet time anymore.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:58.750
Amu-chan!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.120
It's terrible! Just awful!

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.970
A-Amu-chan!

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:07.470
S-Save me!

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:09.440
What do we do? What do we do?

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.470
Calm down, everyone!

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.600
Let's go!

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.950
Okay!

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:18.720
Yikes!

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.270
I am reporting live from the scene.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:30.740
Crab on the rampage! What will be the fate of Guardian Character Miki?! Terror!

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:27.720
It appears that the fugitive crab has taken Guardian Character Miki hostage!

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:30.720
I-I don't think this is the time to be playing around!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:35.060
H-Hurry up!

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:35.960
Chief!

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:36.680
Give us your orders!

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.170
Um...

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.100
B-But it's...

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:42.850
Impossible!

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:45.470
Seriously?

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:50.930
What? Right now?

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:54.970
I'm rather busy looking for research materials.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.010
Okay, okay.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:58.240
Just let me handle it.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:02.470
The day I'll be able to present the Embryo to the Boss is near at hand.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.730
If you'll excuse me.

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:06.940
Yes.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.470
Very near.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.460
The Embryo is nearly complete.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.470
That makes me the winner.

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:19.040
Climbing to the top of Easter is no mere dream.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:21.220
Wow, that's cool!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:23.220
Ah, I get it.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.660
Your egg is in plain sight.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:29.640
Sorry, but I'll be taking it.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.430
Hey, kid.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:33.760
I get it!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:37.100
This stabilizer helps it maintain its balance!

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.520
Hinamori Amu.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:15.870
I'm pretty sure it's around here.

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.270
Ah, over there!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.940
Wow, what a fancy restaurant!

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:26.520
It doesn't look like they're here yet.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.280
I can't wait to taste high-class French cuisine!

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:37.490
One Hour Ago

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.310
Amu-chan.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.160
How about having dinner at the French restaurant in front of the station

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:35.280
as a reward for watching the house for us?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.040
Yay for French food!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.040
French!

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.020
Yay for rewards!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.040
Amu-chan, let's wait inside.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.060
You're right.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:44.400
But hold on. Miki...

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.560
Are you still upset?

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:52.230
Come on, we saved you, so it worked out in the end.

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.140
No, it did not!

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.950
You do not call that working out!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.280
Here, Miki.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.430
Grab on to this!

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.140
Amu-chan.

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:00.980
But isn't that...

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:03.490
The toilet squeaky-squeak!

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.500
We didn't have a choice.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.140
That was the only stick we could find nearby.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.430
It wasn't beautiful!

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:12.300
You've hurt my sense of style!

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.550
Just get over it already.

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:16.190
Cheer up, okay?

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:16.910
Honestly.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:19.730
We're always helping Amu-chan out.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:21.800
But the second we're in trouble, she abandons us like it's nothing.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:26.370
As far as Amu-chan's concerned, we're nothing more than toilet squeaky-squeaks!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:27.560
Stubborn!

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.750
Let me out!

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.720
I object to the abuse of Guardian Characters!

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:33.560
I'll sue you the second I'm out of here!

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:33.560
Another pointless fight.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.570
Lemme out!

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.570
Don't worry.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:37.290
Lemme out!

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:37.290
Amu-chan isn't a petty girl.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:38.940
Understood.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.970
I will take good care of your belongings.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.600
Petty!

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:52.140
I'm in luck.

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:58.380
It appears that I'll be able to obtain a special egg with miraculous timing.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.030
Scawy!

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:21.440
Lobster scawy!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.690
You mean, "that lobster is scary."

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.920
Beat it up, Sis!

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:30.040
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.020
N-Nothing.

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:33.680
Sorry, I'll be right back.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.880
What's with her all of a sudden?

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.280
It's rude to ask that of a lady.

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.200
The restroom.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.320
Oh, I get it.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.680
She always takes forever in there.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:48.650
I feel sort of bad about what I did.

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:50.270
I apologize for the wait.

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:51.540
This was the item, correct?

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.770
Ah, yes.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.120
Hope they aren't angry.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.190
U-Um...

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.390
The stuff that was inside...

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.850
Those idiots.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:08.210
I-Is there some sort of problem?

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.080
Lobster is good!

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.930
Scary but good!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.930
You mean, "lobster is delicious."

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.150
I should be okay for a bit.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:19.770
Honestly.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.180
Making me waste my time...

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.470
I fell asleep.

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:33.040
Isn't Amu-chan done eating yet?

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.710
Huh? It won't open.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.630
Neither will mine.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.470
Sounds like you guys woke up.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:41.300
Miki.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.470
What's going on?

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:47.740
I think we've been locked in.

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.970
Based on my reasoning, Amu-chan is being mean.

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:56.070
Amu-chan?

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:01.970
Hello, Hinamori Amu's Guardian Characters.

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.060
Did you sleep well?

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:06.060
Nikaidou-sensei?

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:08.050
Whoa! What's with this tape?

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:10.520
I can't get out!

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:13.800
That sealing tape was made especially for Guardian Characters.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:16.770
You won't be able to escape.

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:21.410
I couldn't let this chance slip away.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:23.530
Why are you doing this?

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.390
What are you going to do with us?

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.960
Cooking happens to be one of my hobbies.

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:30.260
Does that give you a general idea?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.570
C-Cooking?!

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:35.390
We may be eggs, but we certainly don't taste good!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:39.170
I'm not actually going to eat you.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:40.520
You'll see soon enough.

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:45.390
Where did they go?

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:55.430
Ran, Miki, Su.

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:05.100
You looking for something-nya?

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:06.810
You're...

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:08.650
Which means Ikuto's here, too?

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:11.010
I'm not with Ikuto.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:16.700
I'm in the middle of a vital secret mission he sent me on-nya.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:17.850
A secret mission?

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:20.330
Wanna hear about it, do you?

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.360
Not really.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:24.910
Anyway, do you know where my Guardian Characters went?

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:25.740
Oh?

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:28.430
So you do want to know about my secret mission.

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.220
What do you mean?

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.320
I won't tell you any more-nya.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.550
Okay, guys.

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:35.890
Let's continue the mission.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.010
Wait!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.470
What is it-nya?

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:42.680
Does your secret mission have something to do with my Guardian Characters?

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.220
Beats me-nya.

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.560
What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:52.280
If you tell me about your mission, I'll give you three branches of catnip.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:55.330
D-Don't play me for a fool. You can't buy me with...

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.470
Four branches!

00:15:58.630 --> 00:15:59.970
How about five?

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:01.190
Deal!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.050
The truth is-nya...

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:08.520
We're trying to figure out what Nikaidou's up to.

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:09.650
Nikaidou?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:10.380
Yeah!

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:12.430
So we were keeping an eye on him,

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:15.890
when we happened to see him steal your eg-

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:17.760
What did you just say?

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:22.390
I-I said we saw Nikaidou steal your eggs!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:23.190
No way.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.020
They were taken by Nikaidou.

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:28.480
What do I do?

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:29.560
What do I do?

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:34.580
It's my fault.

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:37.810
Because I was so mean to them.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.150
That's the deal, okay?

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:44.960
I get four more branches if I take you to Nikaidou, okay-nya?

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:45.520
Uh-huh!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.460
Hurry it up.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.000
Hey!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.620
Are you sure this is the right way?

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:03.870
Alley cats are all about shortcuts, shortcuts-nya.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.680
We're climbing that wall next-nya.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.000
There's no way!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:13.540
Who knows what'll happen to your precious eggs if you keep dawdling.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:18.880
Ran, Miki, Su.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.060
Ikuto.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.060
You sure like to fall.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.130
Wha-

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:35.900
Ikuto.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:36.500
Yoru,

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.020
what's going on here?

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:40.340
I don't remember telling you to keep an eye on her.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:43.490
Uh, well, this and that happened and then catnip...

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:46.540
Man.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.370
Sorry-nya.

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.440
Make sure you give him the catnip later.

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:52.640
I know that.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:56.660
Hey.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.390
You're heavier than I thought.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.430
I'll beat you to a pulp when this is over.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.930
It's no use. It won't move at all.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:10.930
Amu-chan.

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:16.980
Hey, Ikuto!

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.190
Found him-nya!

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:18.930
Really?

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:24.810
Nikaidou!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.370
It's Amu-chan's voice!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.850
She's come to save us!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:30.240
Well, well.

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:31.850
If it isn't Hinamori-san.

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:33.080
Nikaidou!

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.560
You should address your teacher as Nikaidou-sensei.

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.620
You're no teacher!

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:39.310
You're one of Easter's minions!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:45.020
You're the one who put X's on Yuki-chan's and Maika-chan's eggs!

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.400
Yes, that's right.

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:53.020
I had to retrieve eggs from every child I could in my search for the Embryo.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.470
Which is why

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:59.970
I immediately snuck into your school as a teacher.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.090
Of course,

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:04.680
I gave up that inefficient method long ago.

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:05.850
Don't mess with me!

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.390
Give me back my eggs!

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:08.100
Wait!

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:14.180
Amu-chan!

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.590
So powerless.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.510
Now that I've assembled the power of the X Eggs,

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.390
I can even do this.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.850
Didn't you say you would remove all the X's from the eggs I marked?

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:30.620
What will you do?

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.960
You can't Character Change or Character Transform.

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.100
Well, what will you do Hinamori Amu?

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.350
Give them back.

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.220
Give them back.

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.280
Give them back!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:49.810
You don't even try to understand how important a child's heart's egg is!

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.020
I understand very well.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:57.110
I'm aware of how important a child's heart's egg is.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:00.810
Even I know that much.

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:03.330
Then why are you doing this?

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.810
What are you trying to do?

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:08.200
Answer me, Nikaidou-san.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:14.940
Did the higher-ups order you to tail me to find that answer,

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.390
Easter's puppet?

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.930
So Ikuto really is...

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.120
Go!

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.570
What are you doing?

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:30.190
Hurry up and destroy the X Eggs!

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.430
Shut up.

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.640
You're not even worth fighting.

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:43.040
Well, have a nice day.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.770
Amu-chan!

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:46.850
Wait!

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:47.720
Give it up.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:50.270
Ran! Miki! Su!

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:05.300
Nikaidou-san is dangerous right now.

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:07.060
You can't handle him.

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.400
So what?

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:12.140
That doesn't mean I should just give up!

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:22.140
Or so I said.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:24.350
But I don't have any confidence in myself.

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:27.150
I can't Character Change or Character Transform.

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:29.930
What if I can't get them back?

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.890
Terrible things could be happening to them right now.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:33.620
Ouch.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:34.680
Hey! What?

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.970
Dummy. Did you forget?

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:39.340
Protecting students from all their troubles

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:42.120
is what the Seiyo Elementary Guardians are here for.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:43.100
Yep, yep.

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:46.020
When a friend's in trouble, we're all in trouble.

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:47.870
Cheer up, Amu-chan.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.910
If you can't Character Change,

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.950
I'll just work hard enough for the both of us!

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:55.220
Take my Gigantic Rattle Attack!

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:58.120
Honestly, what troublesome servants.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.820
Hinamori-san, we're with you.

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:02.770
We'll get them back together.

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:05.680
Guys...

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:14.020
Hold on, Ran, Miki, Su.

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.920
I'll definitely save you.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.890
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.660
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:48.130
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.860
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.540
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.180
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:05.370
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.490
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.920
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:18.080
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:24.010
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:29.260
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:38.130
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:52.050
This is terrible!

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:55.280
We appear to have been kidnapped!

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:57.180
Oh ho, kidnapped, huh?

00:23:57.480 --> 00:23:58.720
Kidnapped?

00:23:58.720 --> 00:23:59.360
For real?

00:23:59.360 --> 00:24:00.640
This isn't good!

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:03.150
There you have it, Guardian Characters.

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:06.110
Would you like to know about my past?

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:08.310
Amu-chan, save us!

00:24:08.310 --> 00:24:10.050
Not listening, huh?

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:11.320
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.320 --> 00:24:13.050
Guardian Character Rescue Operation!

00:24:13.050 --> 00:24:15.270
I'm going to save you guys.

00:24:15.270 --> 00:24:17.800
So what happened in your past?

00:24:17.800 --> 00:24:19.410
You <i>were</i> listening.
